<title>v5 corpus-replay · checkpoint strength</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --ground:#0e1217; --panel:#151b23; --panel2:#1a222c; --hair:#242f3c;
    --ink:#c9d4e0; --muted:#7d8b9d; --faint:#54606f;
    --pelo:#3fd6c4; --peloRaw:rgba(63,214,196,.28); --pelo-fill:rgba(63,214,196,.10);
    --nll:#e8a23d; --top1:#77aaff; --base:#657688; --crater:#f2596b;
    --mono:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    --sans:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 78% -8%, #16202b 0%, transparent 60%),
      var(--ground);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.5}
  .wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:34px 22px 60px}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;
      text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pelo);margin:0 0 8px}
  h1{font-size:26px;font-weight:650;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-wrap:balance}
  .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:6px 0 0;font-family:var(--mono)}
  .kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:10px;margin:26px 0 22px}
  .kpi{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel2),var(--panel));
      border:1px solid var(--hair);border-radius:10px;padding:13px 14px}
  .kpi .lab{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;
      text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .kpi .val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:22px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px;
      font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .kpi .val small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
  .kpi .delta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;margin-top:2px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .up{color:var(--pelo)} .down{color:var(--crater)}
  .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--hair);border-radius:12px;
      padding:16px 16px 8px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .cardhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;
      gap:12px;margin:2px 4px 10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .ctitle{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
  .ctitle .q{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
  .legend{display:flex;gap:15px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);flex-wrap:wrap}
  .legend b{font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}
  .sw{display:inline-block;width:11px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;
      vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px}
  .chartbox{position:relative;width:100%}
  canvas{display:block;width:100%}
  .tip{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .1s;
      background:#0b0f14;border:1px solid var(--hair);border-radius:8px;
      padding:8px 10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;
      color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;transform:translate(-50%,-115%);z-index:5;
      box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.5);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .tip .r{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px}
  .tip .k{color:var(--muted)}
  .notes{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);max-width:70ch;margin:20px 4px 0}
  .notes p{margin:0 0 9px} .notes b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .notes code{font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--pelo);font-size:12px}
  .foot{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:22px}
  @media(max-width:720px){.kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}h1{font-size:22px}}
</style>

<div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Drews Chess Machine · corpus-replay</p>
  <h1>v5 network — checkpoint strength over training</h1>
  <p class="sub" id="runline">model 20260629-1-Uf4p · Lichess-2026-05 corpus · wide probe (n=4435) · 566 checkpoints</p>

  <div class="kpis" id="kpis"></div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardhead">
      <div class="ctitle">Strength (pElo) — raw per-checkpoint + 10-point EMA</div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--peloRaw)"></span>raw pElo</span>
        <span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--pelo);height:4px"></span><b>10-pt EMA</b></span>
        <span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--nll)"></span>nll EMA (right)</span>
        <span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--base);height:0;border-top:2px dashed var(--base)"></span>v5 baseline</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chartbox">
      <canvas id="c1" height="460"></canvas>
      <div class="tip" id="tip1"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardhead">
      <div class="ctitle">Top-1 puzzle accuracy <span class="q">— raw + 10-pt EMA</span></div>
      <div class="legend"><span><span class="sw" style="background:rgba(119,170,255,.3)"></span>raw</span><span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--top1);height:4px"></span><b>EMA</b></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chartbox">
      <canvas id="c2" height="230"></canvas>
      <div class="tip" id="tip2"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="notes">
    <p><b>Reading it.</b> Points are single checkpoints on the fixed 4435-puzzle battery — noisy (±80–100 pElo swing). The <b>10-point EMA</b> (α=2/11) cuts through that. <b>nll</b> (right axis, lower is better) is the policy neg-log-likelihood of the correct move; it runs opposite to pElo.</p><p><b>Run 1 (to 268.5k).</b> The original v5 training: volatile early, a plateau 41k–67k, a rough trough 76k–104k (deep single-checkpoint craters, incl. <code>step93k=1230</code> and a <code>gNorm</code> gradient scar at 69k=943), recovery to a run-1 high at <b>129k (1704)</b>, then a logit-inflation slump 140k–181k, and a choppy epoch-2 band with self-healing craters. Stopped cleanly at <b>step 268,506</b> for a macOS update.</p><p><b>Run 2 — corpus-replay warm start (right of the seam).</b> Resumed from that exact corpus position; the trainer step counter restarts at 1, so checkpoints plot at their <b>cumulative</b> step. Run 2 opened ~1650 and has ground steadily upward, its band ratcheting from the ~1660s (280k) into the <b>1740–1770</b> zone by the mid-530k–550k cluster. It set fresh all-time highs well above the run-1 peak: <b>pElo 1770 at 538.5k</b> and the lowest policy nll of the whole run, <b>1.8445 at 536.5k</b> — records only ~2k steps apart, the ceiling genuinely rising rather than just oscillating. The tail (~555k–567k) is a wider-amplitude trough (down to ~1642) sitting below that peak cluster but not deteriorating — nll stays in the healthy 1.86–2.02 band and top-1 ≥50%. The one monotone driver is the policy logit-abs-max, which has climbed past 175 with no strength cost so far — the metric being watched.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="foot" id="foot"></p>
</div>

